    "description": "You don’t need more courage.\nYou need the right environment.\n\nMost fears in the ocean don’t come from the ocean itself.\nThey come from feeling overwhelmed, rushed, or not understood.\n\nThat’s why we keep our groups small.\nWhy we teach in a calm and structured way.\nAnd why we take the time to work on your mindset before you even go into the water.\n\nBecause confidence is not something you force.\nIt’s something you build.\n\nThis is what our women-only sessions are about.\nFeeling supported, understood, and able to learn at your own pace.",
